                                "sense_id": "c2c1d63f-8621-3446-9acc-f4f8697ea302",
                                "text": "He whirled and came back open-mouthed, and the little boy and big basket had to whisk semicircularly not to be run down, for de minimis non curat Medicina-even when not in a rage."
